# Osiris goal files must keep LF endings. The story compiler reads "Version 1" as the
# first line of a goal; with CRLF it sees "Version 1\r", fails the header parse, and
# omits the goal from the build entirely — reporting zero errors and zero warnings.
# The goal simply is not there afterwards, which is invisible until something that
# should have fired does not.
src/Mods/*/Story/RawFiles/Goals/*.txt text eol=lf
